Total & AG Exp. Dataset + VAE; Youden/3yr & 14.15\% & 11.65\% & 0.946 & -13.78\% & -8.14\% & +0.41pp \\
Large & Benchmark & 14.17\% & 11.60\% & 0.951 & -13.82\% & -8.02\% & 0.00pp \\
